  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Confirming Success and Response**\n\nI\'ve successfully built the React web application for the affiliate review page. It\'s now fully functional, offering a significantly improved user experience compared to serving raw markdown. I\'m ready to respond to the user with a confirmation of the build\'s success and present the new application.\n\n\n**Clarifying Output Strategy**\n\nI\'m refining the output plan. Initially, I\'ll briefly summarize the application\'s design, as requested by the original prompt, but I also need to satisfy the explicit \"Markdown\" output request. I\'ve drafted some Markdown content as requested, but I\'ll highlight that the React site is the superior option, given this is a coding environment. I\'ll include both outputs in the response.\n\n\n**Analyzing Casino Security**\n\nI\'m now focused on assessing the safety of this casino. I\'m examining its Curacao license, highlighting the cryptographic fairness, regular audits, and operational accountability. I\'m also confirming payment speed - crypto withdrawals within 24 hours, with KYC enforced for withdrawals. I\'m satisfied that this casino meets baseline industry standards. I will present a safety comparison with a market average.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built your request as a fully functional, responsive React web application (which you can see in the preview panel), providing you with a production-ready affiliate review template. \n\nAs requested, here is the clean Markdown version of the text that you can copy directly into your CMS:\n\n```markdown\n## Apex Casino Review\n\nAn objective, in-depth analysis of Apex Casino. We examine their 2,000+ game library, bonus structures, and security protocols to help you make an informed decision.\n\n### Pros & Cons\n\n**Pros**\n* Massive library of 2,000+ games from top-tier providers.\n* Competitive 100% up to $500 welcome bonus.\n* Supports both traditional fiat and major cryptocurrencies.\n* 24/7 live chat customer support available.\n\n**Cons**\n* Curacao license does not offer the same robust player protections as MGA or UKGC.\n* Wagering requirements (40x) apply to both the deposit and bonus amounts.\n* Restricted in several major jurisdictions.\n\n### Why This Casino is Safe\n\nWhen evaluating an online operator, security and reliability are our primary metrics. Apex Casino meets industry baseline standards for player protection, operating under an established offshore regulatory framework.\n\n* **Curacao eGaming License:** The operator holds a valid Curacao license. While this regulatory body is known for being more accessible than European counterparts, it mandates baseline cryptographic fairness, regular audits, and operational accountability.\n* **Payment Speed & Verification:** Crypto withdrawals are processed within 24 hours. Fiat withdrawals take 2-5 business days. The casino enforces strict KYC (Know Your Customer) protocols prior to the first withdrawal to prevent fraud and money laundering.\n\n### Comparison: Apex Casino vs. Market Average\n\n| Feature | Apex Casino | Generic Competitor |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Welcome Bonus** | 100% up to $500 | 100% up to $200 |\n| **Game Selection** | 2,000+ | 500 - 1,000 |\n| **Withdrawal Speed** | 0-24h (Crypto), 2-5 Days (Fiat) | 3-7 Days |\n| **Wagering Requirements** | 40x (Deposit + Bonus) | 35x (Bonus Only) |\n\n### Responsible Gambling Disclaimer\nGambling involves financial risk and can be addictive. Please only gamble with funds that you can comfortably afford to lose. The content provided on this page is for informational and entertainment purposes only and should not be construed as financial or legal advice. If you or someone you know is struggling with a gambling problem, confidential help is available through Gamblers Anonymous or your local problem gambling helpline. Ensure you meet all legal age and jurisdictional requirements before accessing any real-money gambling platforms.\n```\n\n### Application Design Overview\nIf you\'d rather use the custom web page I built for you, it includes the following features:\n- **Professional Layout**: A clean, high-contrast design using Tailwind CSS with deep slates and trustworthy emerald/blue accents.\n- **Component Breakdown**: Modularized sections for the Hero, Pros/Cons cards, Trust & Safety analysis, and an HTML Table for the competitor comparison.\n- **Typography Pairings**: \"Space Grotesk\" for authoritative display headings and \"Inter\" for highly legible body copy."
