    summary: "To determine if \"winbeast.nl\" casino holds a KSA (Kansspelautoriteit) license, it is necessary to check the official \"Register of licensees\" or \"Kansspelwijzer\" on the Kansspelautoriteit website (kansspelautoriteit.nl). The KSA is the independent Dutch gambling authority responsible for issuing and supervising gambling licenses in the Netherlands[1][2][3].\n\nTo verify a casino\'s KSA license status, individuals should:\n1.  Visit the official Kansspelautoriteit website (kansspelautoriteit.nl).\n2.  Navigate to the \"Register of licensees\" or \"Kansspelwijzer\" section[4][1][3].\n3.  Search for \"winbeast.nl\" by its company name, website, app, or license number[4][1].\n\nIf \"winbeast.nl\" appears on this list, it is operating legally under a Dutch license[4][5][1]. Playing at casinos without a KSA license carries financial risks and lacks consumer protection[5][3].\n\nAs of the current search, \"winbeast.nl\" has been identified as an online casino offering a variety of games and bonuses[6]. However, none of the search results explicitly state that \"winbeast.nl\" possesses a KSA license or that it appears on the official KSA register. The provided search results list several other casinos that are KSA-licensed, such as Holland Casino, One Casino, Unibet, and BetCity[2][7].\n\nSources:\n[1] [kansspelautoriteit.nl](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEpv2N4ld-rWMNKi1rBPy6b0sGnglgfjmv6fH0DrnTOW_QS_LOaXyZfny0gykZ6WIG-FDRdRInioXeZrgQq48Uf7xrlRoMz-cxXytqcKbipDfGSrofSiBEOVUb4OnfDoVbL5VFI9nKalaFSszaPElYJWygtRAs37Q==)\n[2] [lawandmore.eu](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEhORl_yrvlBzIvjnRt4XinJs713jb719QFM9V_TGYbQFf_iDrpGfLmWtN7jl3anRsaoo9QR94LRPLiiOrGXcSrHOGxL5qLqUTO6CjCSNn8-kDfVu23-RBIL4VHRmRxEBA6S4hPjLohrA==)\n[3] [openovergokken.nl](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHxV_tFobQqMaC0Ywbziu8OSzFwTWh_NC-XplB-5b_VNc6QyypI2PsYzNK81xkxqWJvkTPSnfxpS2zPQn