      title: "trustpilot.com"
    }
    summary: "WinBeast Casino is an online gambling platform that launched in 2025[1]. The casino offers a vast selection of over 8,000 games, including slots, live casino options, and table games, from more than 50 software providers such as Pragmatic Play, NetEnt, and Evolution Gaming[2][3][4][5].\n\nWinBeast Casino supports both traditional fiat payments (like Visa, Mastercard, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and Bank Transfer) and various cryptocurrencies (including Bitcoin, Ethereum, and Litecoin)[2]. The platform offers various bonuses and promotions, including a welcome package that can be up to \342\202\2543,000 plus 300 free spins, as well as weekly reload bonuses and cashback offers[1][3][4][6][5].\n\nThe casino states it operates under a Curacao and Costa Rica license, although some reviews note that specific license numbers are not always clearly displayed, leading to concerns about transparency[1][7]. WinBeast Casino caters to an international audience, with its interface available in English, Dutch, and Greek, and specifically markets to Dutch-speaking and UK players[1][8][3][4].\n\nWhile the website operates primarily through mobile browsers, it also offers a web-app installation for iOS and Android devices, providing full functionality for gaming, payments, and live chat[1][4][5]. Customer support is available 24/7 via live chat[3][4].\n\nOn Trustpilot, winbeast.com has an average rating of 3.4 or 3.5 out of 5 stars based on over 300 reviews[9][10]. Feedback from users is mixed, with some praising fast payouts and a good selection of games, while others have reported issues with withdrawal processing times, particularly for larger amounts, and have raised concerns about the clarity of licensing information[9][10]. Deposits typically need to be wagered multiple times before withdrawal, especially for non-slot games[2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [betterbonus.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGimcXAzmvcX_gSE-qHhx3A7tlar1LI52JVTBMmQt1WJzNgc_2ccpwjF265hGYM3eTUVE0iyrFF997F3FVUTgAyqA4QNoZy1pAHe1IwxtUdCbtSSNsz4zRq0DsgEzvnhfgEmhoPra4K-M-RX1c10__A)\n[2] [correctcasinos.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGKaoNgf1HgV5IkmQ1AOu4-Y0maqQ7uMb_dxVvwz_Wb0s1pMs3-vjei_TXlmaCMt9Wt6g1_GVFLvoqJu9asrb753EAWuviJWyBbmigSUyWKbTko7qowomMW7qEf5_AckjfHKEGQIy_FiNbKdNwPc13v)\n[3] [winbeast.nl](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGDfNPMy650Z311-Mf-R2PWgv6k68sZO_Z60hH3YsBTl4FUYjw3zRujTK9JJWxLYW3rfhftv3EPaJKXCLzLwJ9GbaTDdY23wfVy96gYYPU=)\n[4] [winbeast.nl](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFPCEcQpFw21Xy9F4mwwk9gEszxl6oqi0qNQEVnkM3lcjMdGeennhK4gflP0vU-mXC0QLIPeXCAA9aKLjkQ8nP-CV5ThhhWaVTHnx-V7NtK8OO1)\n[5] [winbeast.nl](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH2cW-Vo6knV6ENG7J9Ep0bODFrzfFl1pawdp0XqNiW-WrvOCGC0sLZpxwSAz-G_rvawIjwkq5jGrrvZ4gKcK-fGsaCA5O-etN-FcN-wQPGV6tXoDw=)\n[6] [winbeast.nl](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHTnoND1ppeEmFYnuK91Ki6zC3z3M7JiBpfrK49EU018Tn27XAW1S7vlSYmwSXaDspuE3WfT-Gp3pYkW1abfiISEblYyuln36w2lSgBOQYpcUbTLtk=)\n[7] [betpack.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHiSCPoi17T_mpmbcTEpqQSz3uftd2PCIwQ0WpTXpEkzfyo9zkcfLkkMA4JHn7fmumHX_YwmMc69jv340oWDqpX9FZnE_beFaCdV_1xJHrNnyBENW1jlSh3dilxV3XwMlQww5U=)\n[8] [uk.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtqHDJ-gdGrYEJC_tRcgnzuPGkXkgudFTNZcPE7JplE0dH_HIAO8aVb6-qCbvEWKkshM5r0EFVFTxxXAVjX9d_B941gkI72HtqLiNX-S-rIi5GlnS9B7Zk)\n[9] [trustpilot.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHWDUrpTl8sAGM4iR2q-RjBuASF9CobSkHA8q3XR4VxB98K6aMbcqZrKBrodEgaVi0pdrjve_uIDLVAEAKVun9_5_SrYc4kzzW35F4myIFuSzHe3r94aDSqpi4wACjHcIlH2vqyCPdrkg==)\n[10] [trustpilot.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHAwG8ugiuuqJ-J9onLhCVlt8PMO1hSq5HdlOTW54l6oleJdNJ5oxogP4s-bEI8xUx0g10Wy8lhkad8BYSe