    summary: "The Kansspelautoriteit (KSA) is the official and sole regulatory body for gambling in the Netherlands, responsible for issuing licenses to online casinos and sports betting operators[1][2]. To confirm if an online casino operates legally in the Netherlands, it must possess a valid KSA license[3].\n\nCurrently, there is no direct information within the search results indicating that \"winbeast.nl\" is licensed by the Kansspelautoriteit[4][5][2]. While \"winbeast.nl\" presents itself as an online casino offering a wide array of games, bonuses, and payment options, including cryptocurrency, it is crucial to verify its licensing status with the official Dutch regulator[6][7][8][9].\n\nTo determine if \"winbeast.nl\" is a legal operator in the Netherlands, users should visit the official Kansspelautoriteit website (www.kansspelautoriteit.nl) and cross-reference the casino\'s name on their official list of license holders[3]. Legal Dutch online casinos are required to display the KSA logo, which, when clicked, should redirect to the official KSA website for verification[3].\n\nSources:\n[1] [chipy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGi-D3eWVbHPHdiC-w72WyJH8hJmClnLYwLQLCtnnjBY15KZ_79JC3HWmo95xk_Z-K_IMugJgAoEOlw5ba9OUBa9z_Lq6wvT2HjmYqxRpGNNzqDgL1pXcOGgbKkr4cmaoQmLySmnXEA)\n[2] [lcb.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH4eYU6L0aRRHFjpWwezsNVx5aFdmR23AsMDVmTbZtoDqohxe_qHquynDnSnX202aBL8Ty5IGU--rAH1XdzblcM1qgDMqXRZpFlNQJxmVzwQcXl23-r-Zhht3avrwPhxoSVl_I=)\n[3] [nltimes.nl](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEuIGKeQhXy0x1ZKbvLYRRKbXE3RQuLALdMmaR8hLnpiND6FwHk-5L_IimL0K26QcsSH938khxtLA5BKbYFvsA6DPN90iBc5s1KsU31W8YGrftSa83tLko_re_W-XD1lzbA_6CKG7-0hlw2pvldf4Mk4CS8uaVYL_zjHZ92afA=)\n[4] [gambl.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHrChoSDuBtaGDIO4jCHzS6eRjtFN-Mt2i_7q3Im438sUqmG17Ua8DQ60WYQZ43Wq4PPo-PtwAOyLNXqBwGyM0zm5mUa7rEjFHP