  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have updated the application to reflect the review for Bitz Casino (bitz.io), focusing heavily on compliance, licensing, and responsible gambling as requested. Additionally, I have generated a raw Markdown version of the review and saved it as `/bitz-review.md`. \n\nHere is the requested output in Markdown format:\n\n```markdown\n**This operator does not hold a license in Netherlands and is not recommended for residents of this region.**\n\n# Bitz Casino (bitz.io) Review\n\n## Summary\nBitz Casino (bitz.io) is a cryptocurrency-centric offshore gambling platform. While it offers a large volume of games and fast crypto transactions, it completely bypasses European regulatory frameworks. This review examines the platform\'s compliance, security, and bonus terms with a strict focus on player safety. Due to the lack of a Kansspelautoriteit (KSA) license, Dutch players have no legal protection when interacting with this operator.\n\n## Pros & Cons\n\n**Pros:**\n- Extensive library of slots and live dealer games.\n- Instant deposits and fast withdrawals using cryptocurrencies.\n- High degree of privacy due to minimal initial KYC requirements.\n\n**Cons:**\n- Does not hold a license in the Netherlands (No KSA jurisdiction).\n- No mandatory responsible gambling limits or CRUKS integration.\n- Difficult-to-clear bonus terms with high wagering requirements.\n- No support for local payment methods like iDEAL.\n\n## Security & License\nBitz Casino operates as an offshore platform and does not hold a valid license from the Dutch Kansspelautoriteit (KSA) or any other strict European regulatory body. This means the casino is not legally permitted to accept players from the Netherlands. Players who choose to bypass these restrictions do so at significant risk, as they forfeit all consumer protections, guaranteed payouts, and legal recourse in the event of a dispute. The platform relies on cryptocurrency anonymity, which further complicates accountability.\n\n## Bonus Terms Analysis\nThe promotional offers at Bitz Casino feature substantial theoretical value but come with predatory conditions. \n**This bonus is difficult to clear for casual players due to the high wagering requirement.**\nThe standard welcome offer frequently imposes wagering requirements of 40x or higher, which often apply to *both* the deposit and the bonus amount. This statistical barrier makes it highly improbable for standard players to convert bonus funds into withdrawable cash. Furthermore, strict game contribution limits and max bet caps during active bonuses further diminish the actual value of the promotion.\n\n## Payment Methods\nAs a crypto-first casino, Bitz.io processes payments entirely through blockchain networks. \n- **Supported Methods:** Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Tether (USDT), and other major altcoins.\n- **Processing Times:** Deposits are generally instant (depending on network confirmations), and withdrawals are processed within 24 hours.\n- **Drawbacks for NL Players:** The casino does not support iDEAL, Maestro, or direct SEPA transfers, which are the standard, secure payment methods mandated for regulated Dutch operators.\n\nWat kost gokken jou? Stop op tijd. 18+\n```"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
